[01:30.95]I keep a bag of my memories
{"我将回忆装进行囊"}
[01:38.34]Here on the seat that is next to me
{"放在身旁的座位上"}
[01:45.07]Watching as the time goes by
{"看着时光缓缓流淌"}
[01:49.00]So beautiful, the scenery
{"沿途风景令人神往"}
[01:52.55]Everything I feel comes alive
{"所有感受重焕光芒"}
[01:55.90]Sweet tears fill my eyes
{"甜蜜泪水盈满眼眶"}
[01:59.50]I'm forever with the memory
{"我永远与回忆相伴"}
[02:06.97]I see reflections in the night
{"夜色中倒影在荡漾"}
[02:13.14]Hand in hand, at sunrise
{"十指紧扣共迎晨光"}
[02:22.25]You and I, we arrive
{"你我终抵达这地方"}
[02:28.15]Memory
{"记忆"}
[03:01.06]One photograph that I keep with me
{"随身携带那张相片"}
[03:07.87]Keeps all the warmth I could ever need
{"珍藏所有所需温暖"}
[03:15.10]Train tracks become a lullaby
